# Story 7.1: Correct the tier boundary

Status: Draft

## Story
As a customer, I want the right tier applied at a boundary, so that I am not overcharged.

## Acceptance Criteria
- AC-1 (P0): Given a volume exactly on a threshold, when the tier is resolved, then the lower tier applies.

